{"id":"sl/y90nupkv","index":0,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"BLANK"},"title":"Clinical Compass","elements":[{"id":"sh/vyp0je1s","kind":"textbox","text":"Clinical Compass","position":{"left":56,"top":229.32,"width":1168,"height":100},"style":{"fontSize":99.33,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}},{"id":"sh/wzy1szid","kind":"textbox","text":"Система хранения и обработки данных о пациенте","position":{"left":60,"top":346.21,"width":1160,"height":88},"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#ADC5FF","alignment":"center"}},{"id":"sh/h072l4jy","kind":"textbox","text":"Ф(Э)ФМ","position":{"left":56,"top":390.68,"width":1168,"height":100},"style":{"fontSize":64.67,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#FFFFFF","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}},{"id":"sh/i1gje90j","kind":"textbox","text":"1","position":{"left":1164,"top":669,"width":60,"height":30},"style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#ADC5FF","alignment":"right"}}],"notes":{"text":"Clinical Compass — рабочий прототип для наблюдения между приёмами. В презентации используются синтетические истории. Модель готовит материал для проверки врачом. Клиническая эффективность и экономия рабочего времени врача ещё не измерены.\n\nИсточники: README.md; docs/demo-scenarios.md"}}
{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"BLANK"},"title":"Проблема","elements":[{"id":"sh/je9crql0","kind":"shape","position":{"left":40,"top":26,"width":1200,"height":66},"style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#000000","alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/ru5cbqd4","kind":"textbox","text":"Проблема","position":{"left":112,"top":38.99,"width":835.84,"height":38.02},"style":{"fontSize":32.67,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#292D42","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/69wbilcj","kind":"textbox","text":"Данные пациента разрознены.\nВремя приёма ограничено.","position":{"left":56,"top":128,"width":1168,"height":130},"style":{"fontSize":49,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}},{"id":"im/2l4b6hsf","kind":"image","position":{"left":55,"top":37,"width":44,"height":44}},{"id":"sh/svedkvup","kind":"textbox","text":"2","position":{"left":1164,"top":38.99,"width":60,"height":38.02},"style":{"fontSize":32.67,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#292D42","bold":true,"alignment":"center"}},{"id":"sh/fypcfqdg","kind":"textbox","text":"Перед повторным приёмом","position":{"left":56,"top":336,"width":550,"height":48},"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#ADC5FF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/exgvmlcv","kind":"textbox","text":"Врач сопоставляет дневник,\nанкеты, назначения и сообщения.","position":{"left":56,"top":407,"width":550,"height":120},"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/107uh0v6","kind":"textbox","text":"Между приёмами","position":{"left":698,"top":336,"width":526,"height":48},"style":{"fontSize":31,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#ADC5FF","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/gzydovul","kind":"textbox","text":"Нужно заметить ухудшение\nи понять причину сигнала.","position":{"left":698,"top":407,"width":526,"height":120},"style":{"fontSize":32,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#FFFFFF","alignment":"left"}},{"id":"sh/v2lc36dw","kind":"textbox","text":"Рабочая гипотеза проекта. Затраты времени врача ещё предстоит измерить.","position":{"left":60,"top":672,"width":1160,"height":30},"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Helvetica Neue","color":"#ADC5FF","alignment":"left"}}],"notes":{"text":"Проблема сформулирована как рабочая гипотеза проекта. Исследований трудозатрат врачей, подтверждённых сэкономленных часов или клинических результатов в проекте нет. Приложение связывает дневник, анкеты, медицинскую карту, назначения и переписку.\n\nИсточники: README.md; app/backend/patients.py; docs/demo-scenarios.md"}}
